  "accessibility": [
    "BEAM's accents are made for its navy and read 1.39:1 (#00f6d2), 1.91:1 (#0bccf7) and 2.88:1 (#da68f5) on white: in light the text and control colours keep BEAM's hue and saturation and are darkened to 4.5:1; the turquoise button keeps its marine label (10.14:1), as in BEAM's wallets.",
    "BEAM's top band (#035b8f at full strength) gives its own secondary text #8da1ad 2.70:1 and its sent colour 2.51:1: the band here is 25% of it (4.87:1 and 4.52:1).",
    "BEAM's popup colour #00446c gives its secondary text 3.83:1, sent 3.56:1 and error 3.50:1: sheets stay on the main navy, where all three read 5.25:1 or more.",
    "BEAM's error red #ff625c reads 4.20:1 on the input colour (and 4.58:1 on cards): error text uses BEAM's failed colour #ff746b (4.67:1 on inputs); #ff625c stays for marks and borders.",
    "White on BEAM's turquoise reads 1.39:1 and on its error red 2.94:1: step marks on them use BEAM's marine #032e49 (10.14:1 and 4.80:1).",
    "Received and sent are never told by colour alone: an arrow icon each, a + or − on the amount, and the words Received / Sent, as in BEAM's own wallets."
  ]
